    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.6.s1",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "4. I have been overpowered, my friends and brethren, for I will now, though I did not at the time, ask for your aid.",
    "chunk_index": 34,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.6.s2",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.6.s2",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "I have been overpowered by the old age of my father, and, to use moderate terms, the kindliness of my friend.",
    "chunk_index": 35,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.6.s3",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.6.s3",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "So, help me, each of you who can, and stretch out a hand to me who am pressed down and torn asunder by regret and enthusiasm.",
    "chunk_index": 36,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.6.s4",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.6.s4",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "The one suggests flights, mountains and deserts, and calm of soul and body, and that the mind should retire into itself, and recall its powers from sensible things,",
    "chunk_index": 37,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.6.s5",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.6.s5",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "in order to hold pure communion with God, and be clearly illumined by the flashing rays of the Spirit, with no admixture or disturbance of the divine light by anything earthly or clouded,",
    "chunk_index": 38,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.6.s6",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.6.s6",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "until we come to the source of the effulgence which we enjoy here, and regret and desire are alike stayed, when our mirrors pass away in the light of truth.",
    "chunk_index": 39,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.6.s7",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.6.s7",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "The other wills that I should come forward, and bear fruit for the common good, and be helped by helping others;",
    "chunk_index": 40,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.6.s8",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.6.s8",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "and publish the Divine light, and bring to God a people for His own possession, a holy nation, a royal priesthood, and His image cleansed in many souls.",
    "chunk_index": 41,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.6.s9",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.6.s9",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And this, because, as a park is better than and preferable to a tree, the whole heaven with its ornaments to a single star, and the body to a limb, so also,",
    "chunk_index": 42,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.6.s10",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.6.s10",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "in the sight of God, is the reformation of a whole church preferable to the progress of a single soul: and therefore, I ought not to look only on my own interest, but also on that of others.",
    "chunk_index": 43,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.6.s11",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.6.s11",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "For Christ also likewise, when it was possible for him to abide in His own honour and deity, not only so far emptied Himself as to take the form of a slave, but also endured the cross,",
    "chunk_index": 44,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.6.s12",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.6.s12",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "despising the shame, that he might by His own sufferings destroy sin, and by death slay death. The former are the imaginings of desire, the latter the teachings of the Spirit.",
    "chunk_index": 45,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.6.s13",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.6.s13",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And I, standing midway between the desire and the Spirit, and not knowing to which of the two I should rather yield, will impart to you what seems to me the best and safest course, that you may test it with me and take part in my design.",
    "chunk_index": 46,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.7.s1",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.7.s1",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "5. It seemed to me to be best and least dangerous to take a middle course between desire and fear, and to yield in part to desire, in part to the Spirit:",
    "chunk_index": 47,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.7.s2",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.7.s2",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "and that this would be the case, if I neither altogether evaded the office, and so refused the grace, which would be dangerous, nor yet assumed a burden beyond my powers, for it is a heavy one.",
    "chunk_index": 48,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.7.s3",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.7.s3",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "The former indeed is suited to the person of another, the latter to another’s power, or rather to undertake both would be madness.",
    "chunk_index": 49,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.7.s4",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.7.s4",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "But piety and safety would alike advise me to proportion the office to my power, and as is the case with food,",
    "chunk_index": 50,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.7.s5",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.7.s5",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "to accept that which is within my power and refuse what is beyond it, for health is gained for the body, and tranquillity for the soul, by such a course of moderation.",
    "chunk_index": 51,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.7.s6",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.7.s6",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Therefore I now consent to share in the cares of my excellent father, like an eaglet, not quite vainly flying close to a mighty and high soaring eagle.",
    "chunk_index": 52,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.7.s7",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.7.s7",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "But hereafter I will offer my wing to the Spirit to be borne whither, and as, He wills: no one shall force or drag me in any direction, contrary to His counsel.",
    "chunk_index": 53,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.7.s8",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.7.s8",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "For sweet it is to inherit a father’s toils, and this flock is more familiar than a strange and foreign one;",
    "chunk_index": 54,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.7.s9",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.7.s9",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "I would even add, more precious in the sight of God, unless the spell of affection deceives me, and the force of habit robs me of perception:",
    "chunk_index": 55,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.7.s10",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.7.s10",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "nor is there any more useful or safer course than that willing rulers should rule willing subjects: since it is our practice not to lead by force, or by compulsion, but by good will.",
    "chunk_index": 56,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.7.s11",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.7.s11",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "For this would not hold together even another form of government, since that which is held in by force is wont, when opportunity offers, to strike for freedom:",
    "chunk_index": 57,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.7.s12",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.7.s12",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "but freedom of will more than anything else it is, which holds together our—I will not call it rule, but—tutorship.",
    "chunk_index": 58,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.7.s13",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.7.s13",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "For the mystery of godliness belongs to those who are willing, not to those who are overpowered.",
    "chunk_index": 59,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.8.s1",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.8.s1",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "6. This is my speech to you, my good men, uttered in simplicity and with all good will, and this is the secret of my mind.",
    "chunk_index": 60,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.8.s2",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.8.s2",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And may the victory rest with that which will be for the profit of both you and me, under the Spirit’s guidance of our affairs, (for our discourse comes back again to the same point,)",
    "chunk_index": 61,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.8.s3",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.8.s3",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "to Whom we have given ourselves, and the head anointed with the oil of perfection, in the Almighty Father, and the Only-begotten Son, and the Holy Spirit, Who is God.",
    "chunk_index": 62,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.8.s4",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.8.s4",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "For how long shall we hide the lamp under the bushel, and withhold from others the full knowledge of the Godhead,",
    "chunk_index": 63,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.8.s5",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.8.s5",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "when it ought to be now put upon the lampstand and give light to all churches and souls and to the whole fulness of the world, no longer by means of metaphors, or intellectual sketches, but by distinct declaration?",
    "chunk_index": 64,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
      373
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12#GregNaz.Or12.8.s6",
    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-12",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or12.8.s6",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And this indeed is a most perfect setting forth of Theology to those Who have been deemed worthy of this grace in Christ Jesus Himself, our Lord, to Whom be glory, honour, and power for ever. Amen.",
    "chunk_index": 65,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 372,
    "date_range": [
      371,
